# D3-EN-010: Molecular products and aggregate conversion are different outputs
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 starch 0.20g
add v1 amylase 0.010g
add v2 whole_milk 40g
add v2 lactase 0.05g
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
wait 1h
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
